#: 27903d9d0b144c46b560099453efa00d
msgid ""
"``include`` - list of qubes to include, can also contains tags using ``$tag:"
"some-tag`` syntax or all qubes of a given type using ``$type:AppVM``, as set "
"in qrexec policy"
