"``destination_vm``. This setting is given to ``qubes.Backup`` service and "
"technically it’s up to that service how ti should be interpreted. In current "
"implementation it is interpreted as a directory where a new file should be "
"written (with a name based on the current timestamp), or a command where the "
"backup should be piped to"
